WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.560
Have you ever wondered what SCP-1609,&nbsp;
the Remains of a Chair, wants?

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:10.720
Foundation staff snapped a picture of&nbsp;
SCP-1609 using SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.120
while it was distributed in its flower bed.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.320
This was the result:

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.120
“Reassembled, and being sat&nbsp;
in by the photographer.”

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:22.240
At the end of the day, it’s just a chair,&nbsp;
and it wants to what any chair does.

